      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a place holder for doing the right thing so that unit tests can create wgpu::Textures with format external and bind them. wgpu::Texture is needed for YCbCrInfoWithFeatureValidationTest that create a BindGroup since the BindGroup[Layout] now needs to have a sampled texture binding to pass validation. The test isn\u0027t creating wgpu::Texutre through SharedTextureMemory so `texture-\u003eGetSharedResourceMemoryContents()` is null there. I\u0027m just not sure what the right thing is, should we fake STM in tests or do something different?",
