      "writtenOn": "2024-11-22T15:44:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, I have no intention of landing this part of the change I just wasn\u0027t sure what the right way to fix it was.\n\nI guess if the strategy has been to move validation into dawn_end2end_tests that seems easiest. YCbCrInfoWithFeatureValidationTest don\u0027t run except on Android already so nothing is changing really. This also makes BindGroup validation easier since the DeviceNull TextureView doesn\u0027t have to support all the YCbCr stuff if tests can use TextureViewVk instead.",
      "parentUuid": "b58f3fb1_e3330911",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 182,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 183,
